  "id": "USN-9127-1",
  "summary": "vim-syntastic vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Syntastic searched the current directory and its\nparents for checker configuration files. If a user were tricked into\nchecking a file in a directory controlled by an attacker, the attacker\ncould possibly use this issue to execute arbitrary code. After this update,\nSyntastic only reads checker configuration files that are named in the\n*_config_file options.",
